;; expect: main.T3.ctorIdx refused name_taken
;; a derivation generates its functions' names; a constant that already bears one is never taken for
;; the derivation's. Here a hand-written `T3.ctorIdx` answering 0 would make every constructor
;; compare equal under a record that says `structural`: the form is refused and nothing is
;; registered
(import Init Int.decEq)
(type T3 (A) (B) (C))
(fn T3.ctorIdx ((a T3)) Nat 0)
(derive T3 eq)
